  "prefLabel": "Jus 1502.02 Attorney general",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Jus 1502.02 \"Attorney general\" means the person holding the office established by N.H. Const. Pt. 1 Art. 46; and appointed in accordance with N.H. Const. Pt. 1, Art. 46 and RSA 21-M:3.\n\nSource. #8082, eff 5-8-04",
